{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarBottom","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstoolbarbottom"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSToolBarBottom","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"toolBarBottom","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" View helper applies a SwiftUI toolbar configuration.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Platform considerations","anchor":"Platform-considerations","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Available on iOS, iPadOS, and visionOS","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Not available on watchOS, tvOS and macOS","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Guidelines","anchor":"Guidelines","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Test the use of the ","type":"text"},{"code":"toolBarBottom","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for both iOS with Liquid Glass and not Liquid Glass","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you use both an  ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar","type":"reference"},{"text":" with the ","type":"text"},{"code":"toolBarBottom","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the toolbar will be above the tabbar for iOS lower than 26, ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not recommended"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"co